{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Nothing in the world is perfect, just as there is no such thing as absolute despair.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dedicated to all those perfectionist steaks who, after countless falls and crushing defeats, still rise again and again, relentlessly striving for the perfect medium rare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Medium Rare</strong> is a darkly humorous physics-based platformer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up one day as a steak. Propelled solely by your own muscle power, you must rediscover and navigate this bizarre world. Of course, as a steak, you are forever drawn to the flame\u2014you yearn to be cooked, to become the perfect and enticing delicacy in the eyes of others.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Start from Scratch</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950520/extras/eb5df8726306bfc985ab0efe4a1afa89.poster.avif?t=1768537212\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950520/extras/eb5df8726306bfc985ab0efe4a1afa89.webm?t=1768537212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>You'll begin from scratch, learning to adapt to your new body. Sometimes it\u2019s too tender, sometimes too slippery. At first, you\u2019ll face painful failures\u2014some so severe you can barely move. But from these failures, you\u2019ll learn and grow, becoming the finest among steaks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overcome Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950520/extras/015cef1c72f531f2dcd0502b7dcbbc83.poster.avif?t=1768537212\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950520/extras/015cef1c72f531f2dcd0502b7dcbbc83.webm?t=1768537212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>As your skills improve, you\u2019ll conquer one challenge after another. Gradually, you\u2019ll master balance, find the right rhythm, and learn to maneuver with agility. Leap into frying pans and plates, completing a variety of uniquely styled challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Ultimate Test</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950520/extras/3dc89d6d01e2266ccc9252fd6d90ddc8.poster.avif?t=1768537212\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950520/extras/3dc89d6d01e2266ccc9252fd6d90ddc8.webm?t=1768537212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>At the end of your journey, you\u2019ll face the ultimate trial\u2014a testament to your status as a one-of-a-kind, perfect steak. Upon reaching the summit, you\u2019ll receive an incredible reward and earn a place on the global steak leaderboard, making your name known worldwide.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950520/extras/ac53bd37931e42c9ec46ac0911e4694c.poster.avif?t=1768537212\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950520/extras/ac53bd37931e42c9ec46ac0911e4694c.webm?t=1768537212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950520/extras/ac53bd37931e42c9ec46ac0911e4694c.mp4?t=1768537212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You can also team up with friends, playing as steaks or other ingredients, to tackle more complex culinary creations or engage in thrilling steak races.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3950520?t=1768537212","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3950520?t=1768537212","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950520/b6e9a62aa08ab4ea9d9770490cf6cae60c11db3b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768537212","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950520/b6e9a62aa08ab4ea9d9770490cf6cae60c11db3b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768537212","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Nothing in the world is perfect, just as there is no such thing as absolute despair.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dedicated to all those perfectionist steaks who, after countless falls and crushing defeats, still rise again and again, relentlessly striving for the perfect medium rare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Medium Rare</strong> is a darkly humorous physics-based platformer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up one day as a steak. Propelled solely by your own muscle power, you must rediscover and navigate this bizarre world. Of course, as a steak, you are forever 