"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950520/extras/3dc89d6d01e2266ccc9252fd6d90ddc8.poster.avif?t=1768537212\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950520/extras/3dc89d6d01e2266ccc9252fd6d90ddc8.webm?t=1768537212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>At the end of your journey, you\u2019ll face the ultimate trial\u2014a testament to your status as a one-of-a-kind, perfect steak. Upon reaching the summit, you\u2019ll receive an incredible reward and earn a place on the global steak leaderboard, making your name known worldwide.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950520/extras/ac53bd37931e42c9ec46ac0911e4694c.poster.avif?t=1768537212\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950520/extras/ac53bd37931e42c9ec46ac0911e4694c.webm?t=1768537212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950520/extras/ac53bd37931e42c9ec46ac0911e4694c.mp4?t=1768537212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You can also team up with friends, playing as steaks or other ingredients, to tackle more complex culinary creations or engage in thrilling steak races.</p>","developers":["Paramoon Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950520/90de2dd5a733ab4bbd635ba394c89667ad301781/header.jpg?t=1768537212","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"\u4e09\u5206\u719f Medium Rare